<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>DriveX · About Us</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/stylesheets/base.css">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/stylesheets/aboutUs.css">
</head>

<body class="about-body">

  <div class="home-wrapper">

    <header class="main-header glass-panel">
      <div class="header-container">
        <div class="header-left">
          <a href="/" class="logo">
            <img src="/images/logo.png" alt="DriveX logo">
            <span>DriveX</span>
          </a>
        </div>

        <div class="header-center">
          <nav class="main-nav">
            <a href="/" class="nav-link">Home</a>
            <a href="/aboutUs" class="nav-link active">About Us</a>
            <a href="/contact" class="nav-link">Contact</a>
          </nav>
        </div>

        <div class="header-right">
          <div class="auth-buttons">
            <% if (!user) { %>
              <a href="/login" class="btn-premium primary">Log in</a>
              <% } else { %>
                <div class="user-profile">
                  <span class="user-name">
                    <%= user.name %>
                  </span>
                  <a href="/logout" class="btn-premium secondary">Sign out</a>
                </div>
                <% } %>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </header>

    <main class="about-main">

      <section class="about-card">

        <h1 class="about-title">About Us</h1>

        <p class="about-subtitle">
          DriveX is a modern land-vehicle dealership platform designed to make buying and selling vehicles easier than
          ever.
        </p>

        <div class="about-content">

          <div class="about-section">
            <h2>Who We Are</h2>
            <p>
              DriveX was created with the idea of building a simple, intuitive, and reliable platform for vehicle
              enthusiasts and everyday drivers.
              We focus on offering a clear and professional space where users can explore, compare, and discover cars
              and motorcycles in a fast and comfortable way.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="about-section">
            <h2>What We Do</h2>
            <p>
              Our platform allows users to browse detailed vehicle listings with complete technical information,
              high-quality images,
              and transparent pricing. Whether you are looking for a family car, a sports vehicle, or a powerful bike,
              DriveX helps you find the perfect match.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="about-section">
            <h2>Our Mission</h2>
            <p>
              We aim to modernize the traditional dealership experience by combining technology and simplicity.
              Our mission is to create a trusted environment where buying and selling vehicles becomes a smooth and
              enjoyable process for everyone.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="about-section">
            <h2>Our Values</h2>
            <ul class="about-list">
              <li><strong>Transparency</strong> Honest and detailed information for every vehicle.</li>
              <li><strong>Quality</strong> Professional listings with accurate specifications.</li>
              <li><strong>Trust</strong> A secure and reliable platform for all users.</li>
              <li><strong>Simplicity</strong> Easy-to-use design focused on user experience.</li>
              <li><strong>Innovation</strong> Constant improvement and new features.</li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div class="about-section">
            <h2>The Team</h2>
            <p>
              DriveX has been developed as a collaborative project by a passionate team of developers:
            </p>

            <ul class="about-team">
              <li>Marcos Solano</li>
              <li>Pablo Craven</li>
              <li>Rodrigo Faure</li>
              <li>Ignacio Castillon</li>
            </ul>

            <p>
              Together we have combined our knowledge and creativity to build a platform that reflects our passion for
              technology and vehicles.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="about-section">
            <h2>Contact Us</h2>
            <p>
              If you have any questions, suggestions, or need assistance, feel free to contact our team.
              We are always happy to help and improve your experience with DriveX.
            </p>
          </div>

        </div>

      </section>

    </main>

    <footer class="about-footer">
      <p>DriveX is a creation of Los Del Fondo Devs. All rights reserved. Malaga, 2025.</p>
    </footer>

  </div>

</body>

</html>